<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Hanwha Energy H1 net profit soars.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Hanwha Energy H1 net profit soars.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)		    369     vs	  43</p>
<p>    Net			   8.86     vs	1.04</p>
<p>    Turnover		1,487.15     vs  1,086.81</p>
<p>    Profit before tax	10.93     vs	1.04</p>
<p>Note - Hanwha Energy Co Ltd is an oil refinery unit of the Hanwha Group. The figures were provided by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5647</p>
</text>
